      "category": "conditional-accuracy-scope",
      "source_evidence": "The adopted convention requires supplied methods to have smooth-solution order greater than one.",
      "translation_evidence": "The family-wide estimate applies eventually, whereas the cell-specific clause only gives an estimate if an existential threshold lies below the selected level. No qualifying reference is asserted to exist.",
      "impact": "The cell-specific clause does not independently certify accuracy at the executed level. Acceptance would need to rest on a nonvacuous family-quality interpretation with the correct reference domain."
    }
  ],
  "rationale": "The attached source supports the translation's sequential finite-volume construction, and the recorded interpretations authorize additional geometry and quantitative method-quality machinery. These positive matches do not resolve the blind translation's expressly missing stability semantics, uncertain smooth-reference class or effective geometry restrictions. The evidence therefore supports an undetermined, nonaccepted result requiring adjudication, rather than a definitive finding that the construction is mathematically false or a claim of interpretation-qualified equivalence."
